      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她要在这场“有马纪念”当中，\n追上她从小追逐到现在的北部玄驹──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c15cf058545b2e9f75f8f05f27847bbe06ed12dcd943ceaa56783ec3499cbd98",
