      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，当她在亮相圈\n和北部玄驹对峙时，却不禁屏息。\n对方的气场和过去完全不同……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e8bef9054f7a527bbd4d17c2aecd51e5ce882ae132361d9bcc73e09a63a3f05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
