      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她像是要训斥这样的自己，\n不断重复说着“不会输”，重新打起精神",
      "source_fingerprint": "858ced882dbcfc70aa758501989f2a8174f040fd774343ad58f80a91f4486414",
